WEBVTT

00:00:00.552 --> 00:00:02.318
.. tsu forn in Paritsh

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:04.140
un ikh hob derzen di grub

00:00:04.635 --> 00:00:08.662
un ikh hob nit gefunen keyn eyn yidn. dan di yidn zaynen nokh nit ongeforn.

00:00:08.803 --> 00:00:11.396
es zaynen geven di, di poyerim.

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.894
di poyerim hobn alts gevust

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:17.117
un zey hobn mir dertseylt vos s'iz geven mit mayn FAMILY.

00:00:18.237 --> 00:00:19.969
mir iz gevorn nit gut

00:00:20.498 --> 00:00:23.290
un mir iz arayngegangen in kop

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:24.845
aza min moment:

00:00:25.577 --> 00:00:28.794
es iz geven lebn taykh iz geven...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:33.941
di shtot iz geshtanen, di shtetl iz geshtanen oyf a barg,

00:00:34.521 --> 00:00:36.034
un ot iz di taykh.

00:00:36.192 --> 00:00:38.785
bin ikh tsugegangen tsum taykh

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.956
un ikh hob gevolt

00:00:42.064 --> 00:00:43.712
gor dertrinken zikh.

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:45.737
zog ikh ernst.

00:00:46.249 --> 00:00:48.880
un a ⟨nider-⟩ a ineveynikste,

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:52.770
a ineveynikster ⟨V-⟩, UNK,

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:56.637
a ineveynikster, GOLOS, a ineveynikster reyd

00:00:57.471 --> 00:01:01.481
hot mir UNK glaykh gezogt, "vos vestu ton?

00:01:01.572 --> 00:01:03.591
tsulib vos darfst zikh trinken?

00:01:03.613 --> 00:01:07.049
az du host azoy fil durkhgelebt un aroys,

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:09.412
dos hot dir got geratevet.

00:01:09.942 --> 00:01:11.657
dos iz faran a got."

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:14.609
freg ikh, "reboyne-shel-oylem,

00:01:15.122 --> 00:01:18.255
far vos hostu geharget mayn mamen, mayn tatn,

00:01:18.531 --> 00:01:21.110
mayne dray briderlekh, mayn shvesterl,

00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:24.870
tsvey bobes, dem zeydn? zey hobn dokh gegleybt in got!"

00:01:25.804 --> 00:01:27.227
"du torst nit..."

00:01:27.227 --> 00:01:31.430
bay mir ⟨a⟩ ineveynikste meynung avekgegangen...

00:01:31.430 --> 00:01:34.880
"du torst nit endikn mit zikh.

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:38.117
az du host azoy fil durkhgelebt un lebn geblibn,

00:01:38.292 --> 00:01:40.108
TAK leb!

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:44.310
makh ⟨a dor⟩. leb!"

00:01:45.767 --> 00:01:47.313
bin ikh avekgeforn

00:01:47.809 --> 00:01:49.507
in shtot Babruysk.

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:53.692
kh'hob afile keyn gelt nit gehat oyf forn oyf tsurik,

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:55.447
nor eyner hot mir genumen;

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:57.340
er hot gefirt hey, bin ikh oyf

00:01:57.340 --> 00:01:59.188
same heykh aroyfgekrokhn.

00:01:59.188 --> 00:02:00.757
kh'hob zikh gehaltn farn,

00:02:00.757 --> 00:02:04.847
 ⟨V rubel⟩, ruft zikh az⟨oy⟩, ⟨rubel⟩, aza shtang,

00:02:04.887 --> 00:02:06.805
hob ikh zikh gehaltn on im

00:02:07.857 --> 00:02:11.440
un er hot mir gebrakht in shtot Babruysk.,

00:02:12.463 --> 00:02:15.106
ikh bin dortn o gefunen

00:02:16.193 --> 00:02:17.419
a mentshn

00:02:17.475 --> 00:02:19.949
velkher iz geven mir bakant.

00:02:20.007 --> 00:02:21.739
er iz geven fun Paritsh.

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:26.834
 er iz geven oyfn front lebedik geblibn,

00:02:27.448 --> 00:02:29.240
nor zayn vayb iz...

00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:30.631
er hot khasene gehat.

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:34.563
hobn zey mir genumen tsu zikh oyf a por vokhn tsayt.

00:02:36.409 --> 00:02:41.114
nu, vuhin gib ikh zikh ahin? ikh tor dokh dortn nit zitsn in shtub. vos iz bay im dortn o?

00:02:41.114 --> 00:02:43.929
eyn, BEDROOM, eyn KOMNATe.

00:02:44.087 --> 00:02:46.426
hot er a vayb mit tsvey kinder.

00:02:50.128 --> 00:02:53.490
ot hob ikh derzen oto der vaybl, der meydl...

00:02:55.005 --> 00:02:58.272
kurts geredt, zog ikh, "⟨du vilst⟩ oyf mir khasene hobn?"

00:02:58.667 --> 00:03:00.112
mir hot men ir geredt.

00:03:00.642 --> 00:03:02.036
zogt zi, "ye."

00:03:05.772 --> 00:03:07.065
fregt zi, "ven?"

00:03:07.442 --> 00:03:08.904
zog ikh, "kum haynt."

00:03:09.147 --> 00:03:11.807
zogt zi, "haynt iz shoyn shpet. morgn."

00:03:12.707 --> 00:03:15.350
zaynen mir oyf morgn avekgegangen mit ir.

00:03:16.403 --> 00:03:18.315
s'ruft zikh oyf rusish "ZAGS."

00:03:18.315 --> 00:03:21.985
in Amerike, oyf english veys ikh nit vi ruft zikh onet a ZAGS,

00:03:21.985 --> 00:03:23.636
avu me farshraybt zikh.

00:03:24.283 --> 00:03:27.888
zaynen mir avekgegangen ahin o. keyn shuln iz dokh nit geven.

00:03:28.705 --> 00:03:34.400
un me hot undz farshribn. oyf eyn tish hot men farshribn di velkhe farshraybn zikh, yungvarg.

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:37.777
oyfn tsveytn tish in a bukh farshraybt men ver iz geshtorbn.

00:03:38.256 --> 00:03:42.637
hot men mir farshribn mit ir do o, zaynen mir gevorn man un vayb.

00:03:42.153 --> 00:03:43.153
⟨⟩.

00:03:44.247 --> 00:03:46.063
un vu hostu gevoynt?

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:51.801
mir hobn avekgegangen... dernokh dem, iz oysgekumen az bay ir iz oykhet nito keyn kvartir.

00:03:52.009 --> 00:03:55.530
zi hot oykh gelebt bay a kroyve.

00:03:56.329 --> 00:03:59.917
di kroyve hot undz gelozn lebn a monat.

00:04:00.531 --> 00:04:03.920
zaynen mir dernokh dem avekgegangen,

00:04:04.193 --> 00:04:06.144
gedungen a dire.

00:04:06.201 --> 00:04:09.317
ikh hob avekgegangen arbetn

00:04:09.643 --> 00:04:12.860
oyf a, oyf a b- vu me boyt.

00:04:13.845 --> 00:04:18.631
dos bin ikh avekgegangen arbetn zegn vald in, in vald.

00:04:18.654 --> 00:04:22.541
dos bin ikh avekgegangen, a treger gevorn

00:04:22.541 --> 00:04:24.321
oyf a⟨,⟩ baze,

00:04:24.321 --> 00:04:28.118
avu es iz faran dortn o esn-zakhn,

00:04:28.118 --> 00:04:33.003
esn-, TO EST' UNK, alts, ayzns, mit vos di mentshn darfn,

00:04:33.003 --> 00:04:36.265
vos me firt in, in di kromen, in di,

00:04:36.407 --> 00:04:38.032
in di ⟨STORES⟩.

00:04:38.032 --> 00:04:41.143
iz dortn git men aroys, hob ikh gedarft trogn.

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:45.744
ikh bin geven oyf deroyf shlaflekh nokh, nor ikh hob ge- gemuzt dos ton.

00:04:45.744 --> 00:04:46.883
es hobn gearbet

00:04:46.883 --> 00:04:50.846
a gantse brigade goyim, gezunte vi shteyner, hoykhe,

00:04:50.869 --> 00:04:53.023
nor ikh hob gedarft mit zey zayn.

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:55.048
hostu gehat kinder?

00:04:55.050 --> 00:04:58.490
ha? di kinder nokh nit geven. kinder nokh nit geven.

00:04:55.768 --> 00:04:57.250
hostu gehat kinder?

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:03.657
nu, dernokh dem iz eyn mol oyf mir aropgefaln a zak fun a hoykher mashin.

00:05:03.657 --> 00:05:06.467
me- hundert kilo. hundert! s'iz,

00:05:06.467 --> 00:05:09.881
hundert kilo, dos iz avade tsvey hundert fuftsik POUNDn, oyb nit mer.

00:05:10.225 --> 00:05:15.669
kurts geredt, efsher der, sheygets hot mit a bekivn oyf mir aropgevorfn, ikh veys vos.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:21.980
 hob ikh arayngefaln in GOSPITAL, in BOL'- in, BOL'NITSA ruft zikh,

00:05:22.155 --> 00:05:23.246
⟨dortn⟩ oyf rusish,

00:05:23.607 --> 00:05:25.659
GOSPITAL oyf english.

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:29.658
bin ikh opgeven a por vokhn tsayt. hob ikh gekumen,

00:05:29.732 --> 00:05:33.455
kh'hob gevolt fun der arbet avekgeyn, s'iz nit far mir keyn arbet,

00:05:33.462 --> 00:05:35.531
geyn zukhn ergets andersh.

00:05:37.174 --> 00:05:41.083
der, direktor fun der PREDPRIYATIE, der MENEDZHER

00:05:41.443 --> 00:05:48.102
hot gedarft aroysgebn mayne dokumentn. er hot, nu, dortn treger zaynen a sakh, a man fuftsik.

00:05:48.278 --> 00:05:49.521
⟨er veys zey⟩.

00:05:49.881 --> 00:05:52.423
er leyent iber az ikh bin geven

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:56.658
a komandir fun a BATAREYA,

00:05:57.441 --> 00:06:00.894
ikh bin a, ikh ho- ikh bin a gelernter.

00:06:02.031 --> 00:06:03.898
er iz geven a polkovnik,

00:06:05.052 --> 00:06:07.290
un ikh bin geven a KOMANDIR BATAREI,

00:06:08.241 --> 00:06:11.593
a eybershter leytenant.

00:06:11.886 --> 00:06:17.719
zogt er, "ikh loz dir nit op. du vest bay mir ⟨n-⟩ geyn," zogt er, "arbetn oyf a baze,

00:06:18.130 --> 00:06:19.389
oyf der baze."

00:06:20.458 --> 00:06:25.300
dortn er hot mir gegebn aza min arbet avu me hot gemakht,

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:27.416
RASTRATes: goyim hobn gearbet,

00:06:27.416 --> 00:06:30.890
zey flegn makhn, es fleg bay zey keseyder feln. me,

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:33.007
me ⟨b-⟩ tseylt alts iber un es felt.

00:06:33.081 --> 00:06:37.540
hot er mir avekgeshtelt oyf aza ort. ikh hob PRI- tsugenumen dem ort, a groysn, dortn geven

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:39.302
a sakh milyonen gelt,

00:06:39.544 --> 00:06:41.389
oyf a sakh milyonen gelt.

00:06:41.389 --> 00:06:44.650
es iz geven umedum iz geven,

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:49.690
oyfn gas iz geven skhoyre, in di ETO pek. veltn!

00:06:49.905 --> 00:06:52.869
kurts geredt, ikh bin gevorn frier a helfer.

00:06:52.892 --> 00:06:56.820
dernokh dem hot er yenem geshikt in,

00:06:56.820 --> 00:07:00.361
in opru, i- in otpusk kloymersht,

00:07:00.537 --> 00:07:06.167
un dernokh dem, az yener iz gekumen, hot er im nit genumen, vorem, er hot dervizn vos er ganvet.

00:07:07.101 --> 00:07:08.968
hob ikh do geblibn arbetn.

00:07:09.345 --> 00:07:15.768
bin ikh gevorn an elterer shoyn do o; bay mir iz geven GRUZCHIKes, bay mir iz geven BUKHGALTERes dortn o fir,

00:07:16.146 --> 00:07:18.418
un ikh hob ongehoybn lebn gut.

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:22.924
yo. velkhe yor hostu geven, geheyrat?

00:07:19.892 --> 00:07:20.831
yo.

00:07:23.065 --> 00:07:24.189
velkhe yor?

00:07:23.689 --> 00:07:25.674
in fertsik zekstn yor.

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:29.280
un velkhe yor hot ir gehat di kinder?

00:07:27.553 --> 00:07:33.723
ikh hob ge- ikh hob geheyrat in fertsik zekstn yor, tsvantsik drite APREL',

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:39.649
un di kinder hob ikh gehat, mayn ⟨D⟩okhter iz gehat zikh,

00:07:39.649 --> 00:07:44.210
in toyznt nayn hundert I fertsik zibetn yor in,

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:44.570
un ir nomen?

00:07:44.344 --> 00:07:45.480
.. ha?

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:46.470
ir nomen?

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:46.481
Bele.

00:07:46.842 --> 00:07:51.513
Bele. hot zi zikh gehat in fertsik zibetn yor, toyznt nayn hundert fertsik zibetn yor

00:07:51.513 --> 00:07:55.053
in, YANV- draysikte YANVAR'.

00:07:56.798 --> 00:07:59.340
dernokh dem mayn zun in fertsik akhtn yor.

00:08:00.004 --> 00:08:04.830
er hot zikh gehat elfte IUL'.

00:08:05.657 --> 00:08:07.996
un vu iz er ge⟨vor⟩n geboyrn?

00:08:07.885 --> 00:08:11.140
elfte IUL' ⟨in⟩ toyznt nayn hundert fertsik akht.

00:08:10.483 --> 00:08:11.371
vu?

00:08:11.918 --> 00:08:13.346
oykh in Babruysk.

00:08:12.992 --> 00:08:13.992
in Babrusk.

00:08:14.044 --> 00:08:19.190
un far vi lang a tsayt hostu gelebt in Babrusk?

00:08:19.208 --> 00:08:22.650
in Babruysk hob ikh gelebt di gantsene yorn.

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:27.150
⟨ikh b- kh'hob,⟩ un kh'hob gearbet di gantse tsayt oyf eyn arbet.

00:08:27.266 --> 00:08:28.266
biz...?

00:08:27.780 --> 00:08:34.693
ikh hob opgearbet bizl zekhtsik zibetn yor bin ikh geven a MENEDZHER fun a groysn baze.

00:08:35.678 --> 00:08:41.870
dernokh dem h- hob ikh gekhapt a STROKE.

00:08:43.474 --> 00:08:45.662
ikh hob gekhapt a...

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:49.171
a harts-atak iz bay mir geven a groyse.

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:54.471
kh'hob opgelegn tsvey khadoshim, tsvey monatn.

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:59.601
dos iz nit vi itster, me ligt dortn opet, tsi, oder me makht an OPERATION. a mol ⟨iz dokh⟩ nit geven,

00:08:59.657 --> 00:09:02.975
in zekhtsi- in Rusland haynt oykh makht men nit keyn OPERATIONS.

00:09:03.319 --> 00:09:06.876
ikh hob opgelegn ⟨azoy⟩ oyf, oyfn, oyfn rukn.

00:09:06.876 --> 00:09:09.690
dos iz geven

00:09:10.187 --> 00:09:12.898
dergangen tsu mir

00:09:13.562 --> 00:09:15.058
di dray yor

00:09:15.334 --> 00:09:17.117
vos ikh bin geven bay dem

00:09:17.798 --> 00:09:19.597
Natsi in plen.

00:09:19.705 --> 00:09:21.842
bay mir di ⟨k-⟩ gantse tsayt,

00:09:21.949 --> 00:09:24.257
nit nit un geven tutvey di harts,

00:09:24.257 --> 00:09:26.668
nit nit un geven tutvey di harts.

00:09:27.602 --> 00:09:28.811
nokhn plen.

00:09:29.323 --> 00:09:30.937
nokhn gefangenshaft.

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:35.300
farshteyst? ot do hot zi gekhapt bay mir dem sof.

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:37.215
m'hot gemeynt az ikh vel shtarbn.

00:09:37.812 --> 00:09:40.067
mayn vayb hot men gezogt az ikh vel nit oyshaltn.

00:09:40.275 --> 00:09:43.526
tsvey vokhn tsayt hob ikh nit gekent afile etemen.

00:09:43.718 --> 00:09:45.332
lebn mir iz geshtanen

00:09:45.692 --> 00:09:47.306
aza min groyser,

00:09:47.818 --> 00:09:50.596
me ruft onet oyf rusish BALLON, an ayzener,

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:52.689
geshtanen mit KISLOROD,

00:09:52.712 --> 00:09:56.290
faran aza min, zoyer-shtof...

00:09:57.049 --> 00:09:58.730
zoyer-shtof oyf yidish;

00:09:59.091 --> 00:10:00.755
KISLOROD oyf rusish...

00:10:00.829 --> 00:10:02.561
mit a shlang mir in moyl,

00:10:02.989 --> 00:10:05.970
mit, durkh vaser, un kh'hob dos gedarft dishen.

00:10:06.988 --> 00:10:12.320
un es hot bavizn bay mir a infarkt oyfn hartsn, a groyser infarkt.

00:10:13.468 --> 00:10:16.860
nokh dem infarkt, gut vos ikh hob far deroyf,

00:10:17.434 --> 00:10:19.959
mit yorn tsurik, in di fuftsiker,

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:22.322
hob ikh ongekumen lernen zikh

00:10:22.632 --> 00:10:24.246
nokh der arbet

00:10:26.108 --> 00:10:29.360
hob ikh zikh gelernt oyf a,

00:10:29.432 --> 00:10:31.940
 TORGOV⟨n⟩-arbeter,

00:10:32.048 --> 00:10:37.930
oyf an arbeter in, vu, vu, nu, vos,

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:42.400
farnemt zikh mit farkoyfn un mit oyfkoyfn, mit altsenesding.

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:45.339
a institut, es iz a groyse zakh.

00:10:45.497 --> 00:10:47.701
fleg ikh nokh der arbet zikh lernen.

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:52.696
ot azoy hob ikh geendikt, iz UNK mit dem diplom, mit dem vos ikh hob,

00:10:53.125 --> 00:10:57.650
hot men mir gemakht far a ey- far a eltern

00:10:57.698 --> 00:11:03.311
in, der, in der, dos o, in kantor, in der,

00:11:04.465 --> 00:11:07.007
in der, in anshtalt, in dem.

00:11:07.148 --> 00:11:12.820
velkhe yor iz dayn froy, geshtarbt?

00:11:13.054 --> 00:11:16.929
zi iz nebekh geshtorbn in toyznt nayn hundert akhtsik zibetn yor.

00:11:16.682 --> 00:11:20.506
un velkhe yor hostu gekumen fun ⟨Rushes⟩ do?

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:24.070
di, zi iz geshtorbn dortn in, in Babru-...

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:29.470
NO, vi, vos y- v- yor, vi host gekumen fun ⟨Rushe⟩ TO AMERICA?

00:11:28.495 --> 00:11:33.740
ikh bin aher gekumen in toyznt nayn hundert I nayntsik tsveytn yor

00:11:34.589 --> 00:11:35.920
'KAY. host...

00:11:35.059 --> 00:11:37.061
in DEKABR' khoydesh.

00:11:37.152 --> 00:11:41.350
host epes vos du vilst zogn tsu dayn kinder, tsu yidn,

00:11:41.350 --> 00:11:44.301
a MESSAGE, epes tsu zogn?

00:11:44.543 --> 00:11:48.180
vos, tsulib vos geyn tsu zey?

00:11:47.547 --> 00:11:52.630
oyf dayn lebn, oyf dayn, vos hot geshen mit dir, host eyn MESSAGE?

00:11:54.364 --> 00:11:56.568
 ikh vel dir zogn,

00:11:57.520 --> 00:12:00.540
, vos mit mir iz geshen,

00:12:01.182 --> 00:12:03.403
az ikh dermon zikh, ikh bashrayb,

00:12:04.084 --> 00:12:06.640
veyn ikh, az ikh shrayb.

00:12:07.105 --> 00:12:12.430
bay mir iz ongeshribn in mayne lider, darf men veynen, fleg ikh veynen. ⟨i-⟩ es geyt bay mir fun hartsn.

00:12:13.956 --> 00:12:16.970
ikh hob afile nit gegangen zikh lernen english,

00:12:17.449 --> 00:12:19.065
vayle ikh fleg

00:12:19.065 --> 00:12:23.247
zitsn un shraybn. ikh hob gemuzt bashraybn alts vos s'iz geven.

00:12:24.334 --> 00:12:27.770
ikh rekhn az s'vet blaybn far imetsn

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:29.925
fun mayn dor, tsi vemen,

00:12:29.925 --> 00:12:32.445
me zol visn ver s'zaynen di rotskhim,

00:12:32.637 --> 00:12:35.010
ver s'zaynen di NEMTSes,

00:12:35.134 --> 00:12:38.013
vos itster tor men zey nit gleybn.

00:12:38.425 --> 00:12:43.279
zey lebn beser fun di, nit nor fun, fun undz,

00:12:43.285 --> 00:12:46.230
nor zey lebn beser fun, fun di,

00:12:46.230 --> 00:12:51.716
fun di Amerikaner, gufe Amerikaner. zey lebn beser fun di vos hobn zey

00:12:51.925 --> 00:12:53.826
gevunen in dem zig.

00:12:54.405 --> 00:12:58.090
zey hobn zey g- gelozn makhn a, dem bestn lebn. zey hobn zey g-

00:12:58.090 --> 00:13:03.039
z- n- nit di, di NEMTSes hobn zikh gemakht dem lebn. dos, di Amerikaner hobn zey geholfn.

00:13:04.497 --> 00:13:06.263
PO PLANU MARSHALLA

00:13:06.505 --> 00:13:09.351
ho- hot men zey geholfn, zey zoln zayn

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:14.470
mer raykher eyder di VOSTOCHishe NEMTSes,

00:13:14.605 --> 00:13:16.130
vos gehert tsu rusn.

00:13:16.377 --> 00:13:20.490
di rusn hobn gevolt az di NEMTSes zoln nit antloyfn aher,

00:13:20.595 --> 00:13:23.474
hobn zey oykhet gemakht az zey zoln lebn beser.

00:13:23.869 --> 00:13:25.652
iz geven tsvishn zey

00:13:25.759 --> 00:13:28.620
a, tsvishn Amerike un Rusland,

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:31.271
hot men ale fun beyde zaytn geholfn di doytshn.

00:13:31.986 --> 00:13:34.494
lebn zey itster beser fun di ziger.

00:13:34.703 --> 00:13:37.197
nor fun undz vos zey hobn tseharget,

00:13:37.197 --> 00:13:39.686
zey hobn gedarft in dr'erd, esn erd,

00:13:39.686 --> 00:13:41.818
nor fanandertsoln zikh mit dem yidn.

00:13:42.347 --> 00:13:45.463
volt di velt dan ⟨v-⟩ vern, di velt volt visn

00:13:45.553 --> 00:13:47.825
az me tsolt opet far aza zakh.

00:13:48.473 --> 00:13:50.216
volt shoyn a tsveyter

00:13:50.216 --> 00:13:53.430
nit vern, a tsveytn mol volt men shoyn nit vern har-

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:56.160
nit veln hargenen keyn mentshn.

00:13:56.269 --> 00:13:58.743
s'iz undzer tsore geven di yidishe

00:13:58.868 --> 00:14:00.750
vos er hot ongehoybn fun dem yidn.

00:14:00.927 --> 00:14:04.040
er hot gevolt hargenen, nokh zayn plan

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:08.710
hot er gevolt hargenen nokh der milkhome ale rusn:

00:14:09.465 --> 00:14:14.740
Leningrad, Moskve fartrinken, tsehargenen di rusn, kastrirn,

00:14:14.764 --> 00:14:17.863
tsehargenen alemen, nor lozn shklafn.

00:14:18.325 --> 00:14:19.621
ot dos hot er gevolt.

00:14:19.621 --> 00:14:22.521
nor di gantse tsore vos er hot ongehoybn fun dem yidn.

00:14:22.881 --> 00:14:27.980
dos iz di greste tsore. meynen itster di antisemitn, di goyim, az

00:14:28.433 --> 00:14:31.028
iber dem yidn hot er gemakht di milkhome.

00:14:31.028 --> 00:14:33.607
er hot gelofn farkhapn di velt.

00:14:34.187 --> 00:14:36.290
er hot gevolt makhn fun der velt gornisht.

00:14:37.056 --> 00:14:40.880
farshteyst? nor di tsore iz geven vos er hot ongehoybn fun undz.

00:14:40.971 --> 00:14:44.480
er hot gedarft fun an andern oyb azoy. ye.

00:14:44.458 --> 00:14:45.458
a dank.

00:14:47.653 --> 00:14:50.920
kenst zogn vos du host ongetun yetst?

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:52.642
 ikh bin zeyer,

00:14:52.716 --> 00:14:54.279
eyn zakh tsufridn:

00:14:54.927 --> 00:14:56.676
vos ikh hob gekemft.

00:14:57.137 --> 00:15:02.510
ikh hob gekemft oyfn front kegn dem grestn soyne fun der gantser velt,

00:15:03.195 --> 00:15:06.530
nor kegn dem malekhamoves fun dem yidn.

00:15:08.072 --> 00:15:09.078
ikh hob,

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:13.146
farshteyt zikh az ikh bin geven a KOMANDIR BATAREI,

00:15:14.113 --> 00:15:15.609
nit nor ikh,

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:19.090
un ale yidn velkhe zaynen geven oyfn front

00:15:19.090 --> 00:15:22.950
hobn gekemft bizl dem letstn zayn patron.

00:15:23.209 --> 00:15:24.885
er hot gemuzt kemfn

00:15:24.885 --> 00:15:26.530
kegn aza merder.

00:15:26.922 --> 00:15:30.021
derfar zaynen tsvishn di yidn geven a sakh generaln.

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:34.171
tsvishn di yidn zaynen geven a sakh GEROYen SOVETSKOGO SOYUZA.

00:15:34.684 --> 00:15:38.106
itster zet ir afile bay mir vos far dem ershtn yor,

00:15:38.106 --> 00:15:41.010
vos m'hot keyn sakh nit gegebn far dem yidn dan...

00:15:41.010 --> 00:15:44.820
nit nor far dem yidn; es iz nit geven in kop tsu gebn ordenes.

00:15:44.843 --> 00:15:46.912
iz bay mir faran oto:

00:15:47.104 --> 00:15:48.341
ersht hob ikh gehat

00:15:48.341 --> 00:15:50.658
a MEDAL' "ZA OTVAGU."

00:15:51.677 --> 00:15:53.662
"ZA OTVAGU" a medal,

00:15:53.837 --> 00:15:55.333
ZA DOBLEST'

00:15:55.491 --> 00:15:58.387
V BOR'BE ⟨S,⟩ mit dem, mit dem soyne.

00:15:58.579 --> 00:16:05.150
itster ORDEN OTECHESTVENNOY VOYNY PERVOY I VTOROY STEPENI.

00:16:05.616 --> 00:16:10.034
nu, un itster alerleyike medaln velkhe me fleg gebn

00:16:10.034 --> 00:16:12.124
yeder yor far di

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:14.232
veteranes fun der milkhome.

00:16:15.015 --> 00:16:19.810
endikndik mayne, mayn geshikhte di tragishe,

00:16:20.770 --> 00:16:22.991
vil ikh betn got

00:16:23.942 --> 00:16:27.986
az er zol shoyn undz, oyf undz akhtung gebn,

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:30.510
nit derlozn az mer

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:32.545
zol oyf undz merder

00:16:32.545 --> 00:16:34.382
nit varfn zeyere

00:16:34.995 --> 00:16:36.356
blutishe hent.

00:16:38.623 --> 00:16:42.600
SHMA YISROEL ADOYNOY ELOYHEYNU ADOYNOY EKHOD.

00:16:42.977 --> 00:16:46.295
BORUKH SHEYM KEVOYD MALKHUSOY LEOYLOM VOED.

00:16:46.335 --> 00:16:49.600
eybershter, helf undz yidn,

00:16:49.600 --> 00:16:53.585
mir zoln lebn, mir zoln derharn meshiekhn,

00:16:53.997 --> 00:16:56.001
un mir zoln ale

00:16:56.001 --> 00:17:00.824
biz eyne hobn yontev, yontev oyf eybik.

00:17:01.489 --> 00:17:03.423
ikh bet dir, got mayner.

00:17:03.285 --> 00:17:04.285
omeyn.

00:17:05.404 --> 00:17:07.726
vu iz di foto genumen?

00:17:08.053 --> 00:17:11.540
fun rekhts zitst mayn tate Berl,

00:17:13.892 --> 00:17:17.429
