00:17:24.455 --> 00:17:26.322
antshuldik, Yankl.

00:17:27.021 --> 00:17:29.380
es iz shoyn durkh azoy fil tsayt az ikh hob zikh,

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:30.744
ikh ken zikh farputen.

00:17:31.881 --> 00:17:35.380
Yankl. di familye zayne iz Kuznetsov.

00:17:36.437 --> 00:17:42.510
nokh Yanklen geyt zayn vayb. dos iz mayn bobe, Leye Kuznetsove.

00:17:43.558 --> 00:17:45.476
